[01:58:27.696] CORE EXPERIMENT - C objects -> virtual addresses (README 九)
[01:58:27.696] ======================================================================
[01:58:27.696] PIE + ASLR randomize ABSOLUTE addresses, but the relative layout
[01:58:27.696] (text/rodata/data/bss < heap < mmap < stack) is preserved.
[01:58:27.696] Compare 'machine' and address widths across x86-64 and ARM64 logs.
